OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATice says government trying to
OL,4,A'retrospectively change rules' as
OL,5,AReform receives #72m in donations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government was already seeking to
OL,8,Fchange the law on donations to
OL,9,Fpolitical parties from British expats,
OL,10,Fincluding a #100,000 cap backdated to
OL,11,F25 March
OL,13,FThe House of Lords will debate changes
OL,14,Fto the law later today
OL,16,FReform says the donations would still
OL,17,Fbe legal, even if the law changes - and
OL,18,FTice tells the BBC the government is
OL,19,F"scared" of competition
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
